<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan to tender on Thursday for 54,000T U.S. corn.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to tender on Thursday for 54,000T U.S. corn.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's FGEP corn-buying group will tender on Thursday for one 54,000-tonne shipment of U.S. corn, local traders said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The FGEP group comprises Fwu Sow Grain, Great Wall Enterprise, President Enterprise, Ever Smile Feed Mill Co and Taiwan Fong Yu.  </p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follows:</p>
<p>				U.S. Gulf	  Pacific N.W.</p>
<p>    One	54,000     April 10-25	April 26-May 13</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
